  "recommendation": "APPROVE",
  "summary": "Lockstep complete and verified: uses-ref == factory_ref == agents submodule gitlink == e17f651; guard test 6/6 green; bump scope matches the description (#574-#584 + release bumps); declared inputs and secrets at the new ref match the stub's mapping.",
